===== FUNCTIONS ===== The catalog of societal functions ("kritiske samfunnsfunksjoner"). Each entry is self-contained - no shared/default table. type: "funksjon" (a societal function) or "fare" (a hazard/event entry). subtype: the DSB samfunnsverdi this entry belongs to - "Styringsevne og suverenitet", "Befolkningens sikkerhet" or "Samfunnets funksjonalitet" (the loader maps these to the internal short NodeSubtype keys that drive node colors). definition: prose definition of what the function covers, shown on hover behind the info icon in the node panel header. Text fields marked as rich text ("definition" here, "description" under SCENARIOS) support a small Markdown subset rendered by src/components/RichText.tsx: a blank line (

) starts a new paragraph, a single 
 is a line break, a line starting with "- " is a bullet point, **text** is bold and *text* is italic. Plain text without markers renders unchanged. functionalityTable: this function's OWN restoration curve - percent still functioning, keyed by [own category][day 1|3|7|30|90]. indirectImpactRow: this function's OWN impact-on-others matrix - keyed by [own category][every OTHER functionKey] -> the category it induces there. functionalityTable and indirectImpactRow are still placeholder values (identical curve, naive self-mirroring rule) - TODO: replace with real data per function.
